{"3159350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Match In Peace", "steam_appid": 3159350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5128260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match two identical monsters hiding inside tombstones to score <strong>Points</strong> and unleash powerful <strong>Monster effects</strong> upon your enemies while managing your <strong>Timer</strong> and <strong>Combo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to score more points to win and progress in this haunting roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/f146cfdd9802336981c05817152d8c5e.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/f146cfdd9802336981c05817152d8c5e.webm?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/f146cfdd9802336981c05817152d8c5e.mp4?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increase your power in different ways</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game with 4 random <strong>Monsters</strong> and collect up to 12 over the course of the run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Stone Cards</strong> that change the rules of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>Statues</strong> that give powerful passive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Potions</strong> that help you win versus powerful enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/b57cc030a29a6abd02cb03489db3521e.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/b57cc030a29a6abd02cb03489db3521e.webm?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/b57cc030a29a6abd02cb03489db3521e.mp4?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get  special Boons not available elsewhere, but be careful, you can get Cursed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/e6ea89c53e93856fdb04c7f7c3e61808.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/e6ea89c53e93856fdb04c7f7c3e61808.webm?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/e6ea89c53e93856fdb04c7f7c3e61808.mp4?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swap shops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gold will find its place in the Swap shop where you can get more useful monsters/stone cards/statues/potions or simply convert your excess gold into other currencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/fa9c2b3d8e3be806354c1380dc83c6cb.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/fa9c2b3d8e3be806354c1380dc83c6cb.webm?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/fa9c2b3d8e3be806354c1380dc83c6cb.mp4?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful enemies await you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to 150 different enemy setups and choose the right rewards for your build. You need to change your playstyle to win these engagements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/92c07be192194a46b6cff507f30a5bfe.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/92c07be192194a46b6cff507f30a5bfe.webm?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/92c07be192194a46b6cff507f30a5bfe.mp4?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to 150 different enemy setups and choose the right rewards for your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong> can give you special Boons not available elsewhere, but also carry otherworldly Curses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game with 4 random <strong>Monsters</strong> and collect up to 12 over the course of the run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Stone Cards</strong> that change the rules of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>Statues</strong> that give powerful passive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Potions</strong> that help you win versus powerful enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap Monsters/Stone cards/Statues and buy Potions and Currencies in the <strong>Swap Shop</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match two identical monsters hiding inside tombstones to score <strong>Points</strong> and unleash powerful <strong>Monster effects</strong> upon your enemies while managing your <strong>Timer</strong> and <strong>Combo</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to score more points to win and progress in this haunting roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/f146cfdd9802336981c05817152d8c5e.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/f146cfdd9802336981c05817152d8c5e.webm?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/f146cfdd9802336981c05817152d8c5e.mp4?t=1788216617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increase your power in different ways</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game with 4 random <strong>Monsters</strong> and collect up to 12 over the course of the run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Stone Cards</strong> that change the rules of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>Statues</strong> that give powerful passive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Potions</strong> that help you win versus powerful enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/b57cc030a29a6abd02cb03489db3521e.poster.avif?t=1788216617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159350/extras/b57cc030a29a6abd0